cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the paper (preferred-citation); if you use the DemonetSim-TH model, also cite the software."
title: "DemonetSim-TH: an agent-based model of retiring Thailand's 1,000-baht note"
abstract: >-
  Agent-based simulation of a demonetization of Thailand's 1,000-baht banknote:
  illicit holders choose among deposit, structuring through money mules,
  conversion into alternative stores of value, amnesty and abandonment under
  capacity-constrained laundering, while honest holders face a liquidity gap
  governed by replacement logistics. Calibrated to India's 2016 demonetization
  by approximate Bayesian computation, with Monte Carlo scenarios, PRCC global
  sensitivity analysis and bootstrap standard errors.
type: software
